                          <span class="opt-item">
                            <strong>(D)</strong> 0
                            
                          </span>
                        
                  </div>
                

                
              </div>
            
              <div class="question-block" >
                <div class="q-stem">
                  <span class="q-marks">[1 Mark]</span>
                  <strong>Q13.</strong> E 31. For a body of 50 kg mass, the velocity-time graph is shown in figure.The force acting on the body is : 1^2 1^2 velocity (m/s) t(s)
                </div>

                

                
                  <div class="options-grid">
                    
                          <span class="opt-item">
