              </div>
            
              <div class="question-block" >
                <div class="q-stem">
                  <span class="q-marks">[1 Mark]</span>
                  <strong>Q14.</strong> A disc of mass 1$\cdot$0 kg is kept floating horizontally in air by firing bullets of mass 0$\cdot$05 kg each vertically at it, at the rate of 10 per second. If the bullets rebound with the same speed, the speed with which these are fired will be-
                </div>

                

                
                  <div class="options-grid">
                    
                          <span class="opt-item">
                            <strong>(A)</strong> 0$\cdot$098 m/s
                            
