              </div>
            
              <div class="question-block" >
                <div class="q-stem">
                  <span class="q-marks">[1 Mark]</span>
                  <strong>Q15.</strong> If force $F = 500$ - 100t, then impulse as a function of time will be :-
                </div>

                

                
                  <div class="options-grid">
                    
                          <span class="opt-item">
                            <strong>(A)</strong> 500t - 50t2
                            
