              <div class="question-block" >
                <div class="q-stem">
                  <span class="q-marks">[1 Mark]</span>
                  <strong>Q17.</strong> 
A 0.5 kg ball moving with a speed of 12 m/s strikes
a hard wall at an angle of $30^\circ$ with the wall. It is
reflected with the same speed and at the same angle.
If the ball is in contact with the wall for 0.25 seconds,
the average force acting on the wall is :-

