              <div class="question-block" >
                <div class="q-stem">
                  <span class="q-marks">[1 Mark]</span>
                  <strong>Q20.</strong> A block of mass 0.1 kg. is pressed against a wall with a horizontal force of  5N as shown in the figure. If the coefficient of friction between the wall and the block
