                            <strong>(B)</strong> F should be equal to the weight of A and B
                            
                          </span>
                        
                          <span class="opt-item">
                            <strong>(C)</strong> F should be less than the weight of A and B
                            
                          </span>
                        
                          <span class="opt-item">
                            <strong>(D)</strong> system cannot be in equilibrium
                            
